  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two blocks of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3m\"></span> are held together on a horizontal frictionless surface with a compressed spring of negligible mass between them. When the blocks are released, the spring pushes them apart and they move in opposite directions.</p>\n<p>What is the value of the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\text{kinetic energy of the block of mass } m}{\\text{kinetic energy of the block of mass } 3m}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{9}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3\"></span></p></li></ol>"
